<title>SWEDEN: Stadshypotek recommends Handelsbanken bid.</title>
<headline>Stadshypotek recommends Handelsbanken bid.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of Swedish mortgage bank Stadshypotek on Tuesday recommended that shareholders accept a takeover bid by Handelsbanken as long as no higher bids are received.</p>
</text>
